  "body": "Your home and batch in one convenient location.\r\nPrivate Sale Price: $1 795 000\r\nFor comparable values, view details for: \r\n3/26 sold 1/2/2026 for $1 870 000 (26C)\r\n\r\nDouble story house with the master suite and open-plan living upstairs to take advantage of the Hauraki Gulf views. Further bedrooms and granny flat are at ground level.\r\n\r\nFully renovated in 2017 to high spec finishes - renovation details, CCC, master builder guarantee, council plans and LIM available on request.\r\n\r\nIn the tightly held and peaceful neighbourhood community of Manly Esplanade on the Northern end of the bay. Mostly retired neighbours. Easy flat walk into Browns Bay village with shops, restaurants and cafes, boat launch, club house, children’s playground  and parks. \r\nSituated right on the coastal walking track - walk North to Long Bay regional park for breakfast or South to Mairangi Bay for a good coffee. Watch dolphins and orca play in the gulf and the sun rise over Rangitoto island - all from your kitchen window or top deck. \r\n4 bedrooms\r\n3 full bathrooms\r\n1x open-plan kitchen, 1x laundry\r\n1x kitchenette/laundry\r\nDining\r\n2x living\r\nEntrance hall\r\nStairwell\r\nOn site parking x3 or 2 cars and a boat\r\nElectricity, gas, fibre, security cameras\r\nMore photos and videos available on request\r\nFull chattels list and full renovation details, available on request\r\n\r\nDon’t buy this house if:\r\n1. You love spending hours on lawns and weeding - this is a low maintenance, lock up and leave property. You’ll trade your lawn mower for a cold drink on the top deck or in the private garden. \r\n2. You need a garage to store your stuff - we converted the double garage into a self contained granny flat that has been a great pad for our young adult children, overseas visitors and extra passive income, when tenanted. We installed a garden shed for tools and bikes, in the yard.\r\n3. You like spending your weekends cleaning house - the finishes in this house are high spec, low maintenance, and look sharp however you furnish it.\r\n4. You don’t mind having your kids stuck on their devices - here you have the beach on your doorstep, the park with a great playground which hosts multiple annual events, famous Penguino ice cream parlour, skateboard track, boat launch, duck pond in Sherwood Park and the tennis club, a short walk away. \r\n5. You enjoy driving everywhere on the weekends and fighting for parking - here you will walk into town to buy your favourite treats from our selection of quality bakeries, enjoy a drink at a local pub and safely walk home, or catch the bus to work, school or uni, right from main street in town.\r\n6. You don’t mind which school your child attends - here your child can walk to school if attending Browns Bay Primary Public School or jump on the Kristin school bus to Albany, if private IB education is your preferred option.\r\n\r\nThis is a house where you will want to work from home and enjoy your surroundings every day. There certainly is enough room to spread out and your piece of mind is protected by a cross-lease. More photos, videos and information available on request.\r\n\r\nIf this is the lifestyle that you have been searching for, want  to see more information or to book a viewing, please click the link to email us and book a viewing. We'd love to meet you and show you our slice of paradise.",
